WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.800
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.070 --> 01:44.030
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.210 --> 01:46.789
[Episode 29]

4
01:59.490 --> 02:05.590
[Tomb of Loving Father Liu Chunsheng and Mother Li Zhongling]

5
02:06.000 --> 02:07.510
Dad, Mom,

6
02:08.430 --> 02:10.229
Zhengguang and I came to see you.

7
02:11.430 --> 02:12.280
Mom, Dad.

8
02:15.750 --> 02:17.150
Why did you bring me here?

9
02:18.680 --> 02:20.410
What do you think of this place?

10
02:23.400 --> 02:24.329
What do you mean?

11
02:25.079 --> 02:25.870
Zhengguang.

12
02:26.560 --> 02:28.620
I've thought about it for a long time.

13
02:28.680 --> 02:29.870
When I get old,

14
02:30.430 --> 02:31.690
I'll come to this place

15
02:31.710 --> 02:33.040
and buy two tombstones,

16
02:34.520 --> 02:36.000
one for you and one for me.

17
02:38.280 --> 02:39.540
What's wrong with you?

18
02:39.560 --> 02:40.820
Can't you talk nicely?

19
02:41.280 --> 02:42.360
I'm in my twenties,

20
02:42.400 --> 02:43.840
and you're in your thirties.

21
02:43.840 --> 02:44.680
Are you in a bit of a hurry?

22
02:44.680 --> 02:45.430
So what?

23
02:45.560 --> 02:47.220
No matter how young we are now,

24
02:47.280 --> 02:48.000
we'll die sooner or later.

25
02:48.000 --> 02:49.870
That's a long time from now.

26
02:50.520 --> 02:51.520
Who knows where we'll be

27
02:51.520 --> 02:52.650
when the time comes?

28
02:53.800 --> 02:54.960
Where could we be?

29
02:56.000 --> 02:56.840
Beijing,

30
02:57.840 --> 02:58.630
or Shenzhen?

31
02:59.079 --> 03:00.430
Or further abroad,

32
03:00.630 --> 03:01.430
like New York.

33
03:03.280 --> 03:04.540
No matter where we are,

34
03:05.190 --> 03:06.630
I'll be buried here.

35
03:07.870 --> 03:09.930
Fallen leaves return to their roots.

36
03:10.150 --> 03:11.590
Our whole family is here.

37
03:12.360 --> 03:13.840
This is our root.

38
03:14.910 --> 03:16.370
As long as our root is here,

39
03:16.470 --> 03:17.840
no matter what you want to do along the way,

40
03:17.840 --> 03:18.900
it doesn't matter.

41
03:19.280 --> 03:21.210
You can explore as much as you want.

42
03:23.310 --> 03:24.000
However...

43
03:24.000 --> 03:24.750
Zhengguang.

44
03:25.800 --> 03:26.800
Anyway, people

45
03:27.190 --> 03:28.450
will all die in the end.

46
03:28.680 --> 03:29.520
Since we know

47
03:29.520 --> 03:30.680
we will end up here,

48
03:31.840 --> 03:33.370
we can live however we want.

49
03:34.630 --> 03:35.630
Zhengliang. I...

50
03:35.800 --> 03:37.329
Why can't you figure it out?

51
03:37.430 --> 03:38.710
I agree with you.

52
03:39.840 --> 03:41.170
I just have one request.

53
03:42.190 --> 03:43.190
When you buy them,

54
03:43.360 --> 03:44.960
leave some space in between.

55
03:45.120 --> 03:46.579
Let's keep some distance,

56
03:46.960 --> 03:48.690
otherwise we'll easily argue.

57
03:51.750 --> 03:52.840
Are you serious?

58
04:02.150 --> 04:03.610
Say goodbye to Mom and Dad.

59
04:03.960 --> 04:04.760
Let's go home.

60
04:08.080 --> 04:09.480
We're leaving, Mom, Dad.

61
04:11.280 --> 04:12.150
What home?

62
04:12.190 --> 04:13.520
We don't have a home now.

63
04:13.590 --> 04:14.630
Didn't we sell the house?

64
04:14.630 --> 04:15.960
Housing prices in Fucheng are low.

65
04:15.960 --> 04:17.290
We can buy it back later.

66
04:18.120 --> 04:19.190
You are quite something.

67
04:19.190 --> 04:19.920
You're really good at

68
04:19.920 --> 04:21.430
making things sound so easy.

69
04:21.430 --> 04:22.560
Really impressive.

70
04:22.600 --> 04:23.530
Warm up a little.

71
04:24.070 --> 04:24.560
Why?

72
04:25.750 --> 04:26.480
Get ready.

73
04:27.360 --> 04:28.430
Let's see

74
04:28.800 --> 04:30.930
who can run to the cemetery gate first.

75
04:31.190 --> 04:32.510
Are you 10?

76
04:32.510 --> 04:33.640
Three, two, one, go!

77
04:34.070 --> 04:35.070
The loser treats!

78
04:36.000 --> 04:38.130
Why do I have to compete with you again?

79
04:38.630 --> 04:39.720
You jumped the gun!

80
04:40.040 --> 04:41.840
Liu Zhengguang, you're old now!

81
04:44.880 --> 04:52.040
[Fucheng City Taxi]

82
05:21.510 --> 05:23.560
It looks like you're physically strong,

83
05:23.560 --> 05:24.920
your arms and legs are in good shape,

84
05:24.920 --> 05:26.120
and your mind is clear.

85
05:26.120 --> 05:28.320
Why don't you find something else to do?

86
05:29.360 --> 05:30.820
This place is so desolate.

87
05:30.870 --> 05:32.270
At night, the wind

88
05:33.920 --> 05:34.680
howls like crazy.

89
05:34.680 --> 05:38.720
[Patrolling. Please Wait a Moment]

90
05:34.830 --> 05:37.159
The elders say it's full of yin energy here.

91
05:37.159 --> 05:38.070
Aren't you afraid of ghosts?

92
05:38.070 --> 05:38.830
I'm not.

93
05:39.950 --> 05:41.680
I'm afraid there are no ghosts.

94
05:41.680 --> 05:43.810
Isn't it better if there are no ghosts?

95
05:44.000 --> 05:44.720
Well,

96
05:44.720 --> 05:46.780
you want to see something scary here?

97
05:46.790 --> 05:54.330
[Patrolling. Please Wait a Moment]

98
05:47.310 --> 05:49.190
My wife passed away not long ago

99
05:49.630 --> 05:50.760
and was buried here.

100
05:51.190 --> 05:52.270
I've been thinking,

101
05:52.270 --> 05:54.630
maybe one day she'll come back to see me.

102
05:55.270 --> 05:57.000
They say this thing wards off evil,

103
05:57.000 --> 05:59.600
but it can't stop people from missing someone.

104
05:59.870 --> 06:01.200
It's cold here at night.

105
06:01.830 --> 06:03.030
You should wear more.

106
06:14.600 --> 06:15.560
Chen.

107
06:18.120 --> 06:19.180
Comrade Changhai?

108
06:19.390 --> 06:20.270
Why are you here?

109
06:20.270 --> 06:22.200
Commissioner Chen, call me Uncle.

110
06:22.830 --> 06:23.310
Uncle Che,

111
06:23.310 --> 06:24.630
are you clear-headed

112
06:24.630 --> 06:25.750
or confused?

113
06:26.830 --> 06:27.960
Your Uncle Changhai

114
06:28.360 --> 06:29.630
knows when to be confused

115
06:29.630 --> 06:30.680
and when to be

116
06:30.680 --> 06:31.800
clear-headed.

117
06:31.830 --> 06:33.230
He knows what he's doing.

118
06:34.630 --> 06:35.690
What's the matter?

119
06:37.920 --> 06:38.750
Junnan,

120
06:40.600 --> 06:41.950
life is...

121
06:41.950 --> 06:42.920
You're still young,

122
06:42.920 --> 06:44.310
so you may not feel the same way.

123
06:44.310 --> 06:45.720
Well, life is

124
06:45.720 --> 06:47.270
not so short,

125
06:47.270 --> 06:48.040
nor is it

126
06:48.680 --> 06:49.510
so long.

127
06:49.950 --> 06:50.880
What I want to say

128
06:52.040 --> 06:53.570
is that you must cherish it.

129
06:54.680 --> 06:55.360
Alright.

130
06:55.360 --> 06:57.480
That's all I have to say.

131
06:58.070 --> 06:58.930
As for the rest,

132
07:00.120 --> 07:02.240
you have to figure out for yourself.

133
07:04.480 --> 07:05.680
I'll leave you alone.

134
07:13.600 --> 07:15.460
[Little Pepper Stage]

135
07:20.040 --> 07:21.070
This is your last time

136
07:21.070 --> 07:22.040
on stage, right?

137
07:23.750 --> 07:25.210
I want to sing a song I like.

138
07:27.120 --> 07:27.920
That's good.

139
07:28.430 --> 07:29.510
In the future,

140
07:29.510 --> 07:30.950
I can brag to others,

141
07:31.120 --> 07:32.430
"My former partner

142
07:32.510 --> 07:33.920
has a PhD!"

143
07:36.390 --> 07:37.159
Who knows

144
07:37.159 --> 07:38.680
what will happen in Beijing?

145
07:38.680 --> 07:39.750
You've been working so hard.

146
07:39.750 --> 07:41.010
Nothing will go wrong.

147
07:42.390 --> 07:43.850
I was just lucky this time.

148
07:44.190 --> 07:45.560
I know how things turned out.

149
07:45.560 --> 07:46.600
I barely passed.

150
07:47.000 --> 07:49.510
I just worked hard on my English and the interview.

151
07:49.510 --> 07:51.430
Fortunately, my former boss helped me

152
07:51.430 --> 07:52.240
and got me

153
07:52.240 --> 07:53.680
two strong letters of recommendation.

154
07:53.680 --> 07:55.720
Otherwise, I definitely wouldn't have made it.

155
07:55.720 --> 07:57.070
You're just being modest.

156
07:57.070 --> 07:58.750
I think you're really excellent.

157
07:58.750 --> 08:01.010
You'll definitely make it in the future.

158
08:01.600 --> 08:02.390
Why?

159
08:02.560 --> 08:03.360
No reason.

160
08:04.310 --> 08:06.270
I'm just sincerely wishing you well.

161
08:06.270 --> 08:07.000
Who doesn't want

162
08:07.000 --> 08:08.360
the doctors in their hometown

163
08:08.360 --> 08:09.420
to be more awesome?

164
08:09.750 --> 08:11.070
But what if I don't come back

165
08:11.070 --> 08:12.400
after I become awesome?

166
08:14.360 --> 08:15.360
That's also good.

167
08:15.390 --> 08:16.430
People always aim for bigger and better things.

168
08:16.430 --> 08:17.240
Right, Sis?

169
08:18.870 --> 08:20.000
I'm just kidding.

170
08:20.040 --> 08:21.390
How could I not come back?

171
08:21.390 --> 08:22.560
My dad is here.

172
08:22.560 --> 08:23.950
If I leave, who will take care of him?

173
08:23.950 --> 08:25.720
You can take him with you.

174
08:27.270 --> 08:28.360
Sis, why

175
08:28.560 --> 08:29.630
do you think people

176
08:29.630 --> 08:31.000
like going to the South?

177
08:31.000 --> 08:32.840
Is it just to make money?

178
08:32.870 --> 08:36.200
But although you make more money there, you also spend more.

179
08:36.510 --> 08:37.789
In my opinion,

180
08:39.320 --> 08:40.630
it's because it's too cold here.

181
08:40.630 --> 08:42.030
Anyone with the means

182
08:42.030 --> 08:42.669
wants to

183
08:42.669 --> 08:44.000
go somewhere warm.

184
08:44.600 --> 08:46.240
Just look at other countries.

185
08:46.240 --> 08:47.360
It's not just us.

186
08:47.870 --> 08:49.240
Northerners all over the world

187
08:49.240 --> 08:50.500
want to go to the South.

188
08:52.150 --> 08:53.320
It's that simple?

189
08:53.360 --> 08:54.360
It's that simple.

190
09:02.870 --> 09:03.960
As the saying goes,

191
09:03.960 --> 09:05.150
"I'd rather skip a meal

192
09:05.150 --> 09:06.600
than miss a sing-and-dance duet."

193
09:06.600 --> 09:07.390
Guys,

194
09:07.440 --> 09:08.910
did you like Guo and Jia's

195
09:08.910 --> 09:10.150
performance?

196
09:10.320 --> 09:11.240
Yes!

197
09:10.450 --> 09:14.250
[Little Pepper Stage]

198
09:12.080 --> 09:13.670
Now, let's give

199
09:13.670 --> 09:15.150
a warm round of applause

200
09:15.150 --> 09:16.750
to Big Pomegranate,

201
09:16.750 --> 09:18.150
who will perform

202
09:18.150 --> 09:20.360
"Train to Spring."

203
09:20.440 --> 09:22.370
Please welcome her with applause!

204
09:22.620 --> 09:28.250
[Train To Spring, Big Pomegranates]

205
09:26.150 --> 09:27.150
Are you ready?

206
09:45.110 --> 09:48.080
I ran across the snowy sky in the north

207
09:48.730 --> 09:52.440
I've been to the rainy night in the south

208
09:53.500 --> 09:55.390
Train goes to that spring

209
09:55.630 --> 09:57.720
Every dream will come true

210
09:58.300 --> 10:00.010
Storms and storms

211
10:00.370 --> 10:02.310
The flowers will bloom at the end

212
10:02.610 --> 10:04.360
Let's go back to the mountain

213
10:04.850 --> 10:06.730
We'll go through snow

214
10:07.200 --> 10:09.060
The people I miss will meet

215
10:09.360 --> 10:11.140
They said don't be afraid

216
10:11.690 --> 10:14.610
Look forward to tomorrow

217
10:17.310 --> 10:21.830
[Little Pepper Stage]

218
10:33.390 --> 10:34.270
Bravo!

219
10:37.200 --> 10:37.750
Bravo!

220
11:03.360 --> 11:04.080
You look kind of lonely

221
11:04.080 --> 11:05.120
sitting here.

222
11:09.120 --> 11:09.670
Here.

223
11:10.120 --> 11:13.320
You're sweating like crazy. It'll help you recover a bit.

224
11:14.150 --> 11:15.120
You're a good friend.

225
11:15.120 --> 11:15.600
You have some.

226
11:15.600 --> 11:16.120
I won't.

227
11:18.600 --> 11:19.660
Let me see your eye.

228
11:23.750 --> 11:24.440
Are you okay?

229
11:24.440 --> 11:25.150
I'm fine.

230
11:25.630 --> 11:26.480
It's nothing.

231
11:27.790 --> 11:29.080
This punch was totally worth it.

232
11:29.080 --> 11:30.670
That guy felt bad

233
11:30.870 --> 11:32.270
and wrote us a 100-word

234
11:32.270 --> 11:33.330
five-star review.

235
11:33.390 --> 11:34.270
Don't you think it was worth it?

236
11:34.270 --> 11:34.910
Yes.

237
11:42.790 --> 11:44.360
I need to tell you something.

238
11:44.360 --> 11:46.630
Just say it. No need to announce it.

239
11:46.630 --> 11:47.390
Just say it.

240
11:50.120 --> 11:51.600
I'm planning to go to Beijing

241
11:51.600 --> 11:53.400
to start a business with Junnan.

242
12:03.200 --> 12:04.000
That's great.

243
12:05.390 --> 12:06.520
Junnan is a good guy.

244
12:07.440 --> 12:08.500
He's kind-hearted

245
12:08.960 --> 12:09.840
and loyal.

246
12:09.910 --> 12:11.440
He gets along well with you.

247
12:13.480 --> 12:14.340
What about you?

248
12:14.910 --> 12:17.110
I definitely get along better with you.

249
12:18.030 --> 12:19.790
Aren't we soulmates?

250
12:21.240 --> 12:22.100
Are you stupid?

251
12:22.720 --> 12:24.450
Is that what I'm talking about?

252
12:25.150 --> 12:26.270
I got it.

253
12:26.750 --> 12:27.750
Just kidding.

254
12:27.750 --> 12:29.550
You have no sense of humor.

255
12:30.910 --> 12:31.750
Look,

256
12:31.840 --> 12:32.750
our business

257
12:32.750 --> 12:33.870
is stable now.

258
12:34.390 --> 12:36.450
I'm planning to hire two more actors,

259
12:36.840 --> 12:38.440
make the horror experience more intense,

260
12:38.440 --> 12:39.500
and make it bigger.

261
12:40.670 --> 12:41.870
You are the chairman.

262
12:41.870 --> 12:43.470
Just wait for the dividends.

263
12:43.670 --> 12:44.480
Don't interfere

264
12:44.480 --> 12:46.120
with my business as the general manager.

265
12:46.120 --> 12:47.720
Go do whatever you need to do.

266
12:51.080 --> 12:51.910
This time,

267
12:53.030 --> 12:53.910
if I don't make a name for myself,

268
12:53.910 --> 12:54.960
I won't come back.

269
12:59.440 --> 13:01.040
Get along well with Gong Xue.

270
13:03.910 --> 13:04.720
I'm leaving.

271
13:08.870 --> 13:10.870
Remember to come back if you do well.

272
13:11.550 --> 13:13.550
If you don't, come back quickly too.

273
13:15.240 --> 13:16.320
Don't forget,

274
13:17.150 --> 13:19.080
someone is waiting for you at home.

275
13:29.480 --> 13:31.690
[1314 Funeral Services]

276
13:33.150 --> 13:35.200
Besides the router, is there anything else

277
13:35.200 --> 13:36.320
your dad needs?

278
13:38.840 --> 13:39.630
No.

279
13:46.000 --> 13:47.240
Let me tell you a joke.

280
13:48.840 --> 13:50.030
You can tell jokes?

281
13:50.960 --> 13:51.960
Of course I can.

282
13:52.510 --> 13:53.960
When I was in Shenzhen,

283
13:54.080 --> 13:55.610
I even did stand-up comedy.

284
13:55.910 --> 13:57.370
You couldn't tell, right?

285
13:59.360 --> 14:00.360
Did anyone laugh?

286
14:00.910 --> 14:02.640
No one in the audience laughed,

287
14:02.720 --> 14:05.320
but the actors backstage went crazy laughing.

288
14:06.360 --> 14:07.560
That's pretty funny.

289
14:07.610 --> 14:10.490
[Tianshan Road]

290
14:11.440 --> 14:12.390
4 scales in total.

291
14:12.390 --> 14:13.200
15 catties, 15 catties.

292
14:13.200 --> 14:13.910
Four scales added together,

293
14:13.910 --> 14:15.550
82.7 catties.

294
14:14.040 --> 14:15.620
[Cabbage on Sale]

295
14:15.910 --> 14:17.270
Four scales, 82.7 catties.

296
14:15.980 --> 14:17.540
[Cabbage on Sale]

297
14:19.080 --> 14:20.030
82.7, charge for 82.

298
14:20.030 --> 14:20.750
Is it them?

299
14:20.750 --> 14:21.510
Charge for 82.

300
14:21.510 --> 14:22.870
82 catties, 82 catties.

301
14:22.960 --> 14:23.480
Yes.

302
14:25.510 --> 14:27.000
This is too little.

303
14:27.320 --> 14:28.510
How can you round off so much?

304
14:28.510 --> 14:30.440
You can't round off that much, sir!

305
14:31.600 --> 14:33.730
Zhang Jiao should be fully recovered.

306
14:36.320 --> 14:38.380
It looks that way. She looks fine now.

307
14:39.360 --> 14:40.750
Let's go say hi.

308
14:42.910 --> 14:43.750
Forget it.

309
14:44.150 --> 14:45.630
As long as they are doing well now,

310
14:45.630 --> 14:46.490
that's enough.

311
14:46.630 --> 14:47.890
Let's not bother them.

312
14:49.750 --> 14:50.630
Alright.

313
14:59.270 --> 15:00.200
It's delicious!

314
15:22.440 --> 15:23.840
Wait for me here for a bit.

315
15:23.960 --> 15:24.630
Okay.

316
15:24.630 --> 15:26.270
Call me if you need anything.

317
15:26.870 --> 15:27.840
Don't worry.

318
15:28.270 --> 15:30.200
Haven't you taught me everything?

319
15:43.040 --> 15:49.640
[Anti-Riot Equipment Cabinet]

320
15:49.670 --> 15:50.870
Where's Zhengliang?

321
15:51.080 --> 15:52.880
I told him to wait for me outside.

322
15:55.790 --> 15:57.120
Since my mom left,

323
15:57.720 --> 15:58.550
it's been a long time

324
15:58.550 --> 16:00.120
since we talked,

325
16:00.120 --> 16:00.840
hasn't it?

326
16:02.200 --> 16:03.000
Yes.

327
16:04.550 --> 16:06.150
But let me tell you, daughter,

328
16:06.150 --> 16:07.670
I'm doing fine now.

329
16:10.240 --> 16:11.390
I'm staying here

330
16:12.000 --> 16:13.120
because I feel

331
16:14.030 --> 16:15.840
that the time your mom and I

332
16:16.070 --> 16:17.470
had together in this life

333
16:17.870 --> 16:18.790
was too short.

334
16:19.960 --> 16:20.960
If she wasn't in,

335
16:21.240 --> 16:21.960
I was in.

336
16:21.960 --> 16:22.510
If I wasn't in,

337
16:22.510 --> 16:23.390
she was in.

338
16:24.600 --> 16:26.730
We didn't spend enough time together.

339
16:26.960 --> 16:28.200
I was thinking,

340
16:28.910 --> 16:30.440
if I work here,

341
16:31.720 --> 16:33.630
I can be closer to her.

342
16:38.960 --> 16:39.750
Dad.

343
16:41.480 --> 16:42.840
I know you feel bad.

344
16:45.550 --> 16:46.480
I'm not against you

345
16:46.480 --> 16:47.510
working here.

346
16:48.440 --> 16:49.970
But we have to move forward.

347
16:53.670 --> 16:54.790
I'm sure Mom would

348
16:54.790 --> 16:55.960
want you to do the same.

349
16:55.960 --> 16:57.510
We can't just stop here.

350
16:58.390 --> 16:59.960
Didn't you tell me

351
17:00.480 --> 17:02.340
that this is what our family does?

352
17:15.589 --> 17:16.510
Before,

353
17:16.510 --> 17:18.109
I didn't like hazelnuts.

354
17:19.480 --> 17:20.609
Your mom loved them.

355
17:21.200 --> 17:23.060
But she didn't like to shell them.

356
17:24.109 --> 17:25.200
So she made me do it.

357
17:25.200 --> 17:27.260
If I said no, she'd give me a hard time.

358
17:29.070 --> 17:31.830
So I just... I just did it for her.

359
17:32.920 --> 17:33.680
Yeah...

360
17:35.030 --> 17:35.880
I would...

361
17:36.440 --> 17:37.920
I'd shell one for her,

362
17:38.830 --> 17:39.920
and eat one myself.

363
17:40.200 --> 17:41.550
Shell one for her,

364
17:42.510 --> 17:43.680
and eat one myself.

365
17:45.750 --> 17:47.010
After doing it so much,

366
17:48.200 --> 17:49.750
I started to like them too.

367
17:52.640 --> 17:53.110
Well...

368
17:58.550 --> 18:00.010
I shelled too many of them.

369
18:00.440 --> 18:01.880
Take them with you later.

370
18:03.350 --> 18:04.410
You and Zhengliang

371
18:04.960 --> 18:06.220
can eat them together.

372
18:10.790 --> 18:11.510
Dad.

373
18:12.240 --> 18:14.400
I know. You're right.

374
18:15.110 --> 18:16.440
We should move forward.

375
18:17.830 --> 18:18.680
You're young.

376
18:19.270 --> 18:20.670
You have to move forward.

377
18:22.510 --> 18:26.200
You are the continuation

378
18:27.550 --> 18:29.440
of your mom and me.

379
18:30.590 --> 18:31.990
You have to move forward.

380
18:32.310 --> 18:33.640
I'm not going anywhere.

381
18:33.830 --> 18:35.230
I'm stopping right here.

382
18:39.920 --> 18:40.680
It's fine.

383
19:00.660 --> 19:06.050
[1314 Funeral Services]

384
19:08.220 --> 19:13.650
[1314 Funeral Services]

385
19:28.310 --> 19:29.170
What are these?

386
19:36.310 --> 19:37.160
Memories.

387
19:37.510 --> 19:38.510
Memories?

388
19:44.160 --> 19:45.790
Aren't these just hazelnuts?

389
19:45.790 --> 19:46.720
Do you like them?

390
19:50.510 --> 19:51.510
Not really.

391
19:53.550 --> 19:54.350
Eat more.

392
19:55.680 --> 19:57.010
Maybe you'll like them.

393
20:21.920 --> 20:22.750
Let's go.

394
20:26.320 --> 20:29.470
♪ A soul that came to earth amid the cries ♪

395
20:29.920 --> 20:33.020
♪ Welcome to this city of haste ♪

396
20:33.530 --> 20:35.820
♪ Grow taller, quick as you can ♪

397
20:36.190 --> 20:38.500
♪ Learn how to find your footing ♪

398
20:40.660 --> 20:43.990
♪ A soul who hid among the lanes and alleys ♪

399
20:44.490 --> 20:47.690
♪ A single turn, and the lamp at the door grows distant ♪

400
20:46.790 --> 20:47.590
Amy

401
20:48.090 --> 20:50.480
♪ The ticket bears no way back ♪

402
20:50.400 --> 20:53.000
Come on. Let me help you clean up today.

403
20:50.770 --> 20:53.160
♪ How like life it is ♪

404
20:55.130 --> 21:02.100
[Mother, Mi Xiaoxia]

405
20:55.420 --> 20:57.920
♪ May every road you take be safe ♪

406
20:57.200 --> 20:58.200
It's clean

407
20:58.110 --> 21:02.220
♪ May the scenery stay simple and carry you past regret ♪

408
21:02.730 --> 21:05.840
♪ Love deeply whatever comes to meet you ♪

409
21:03.430 --> 21:06.990
[In Memory]

410
21:06.350 --> 21:09.480
♪ And let those who leave be buried under snow on the hills ♪

411
21:10.040 --> 21:12.530
♪ May you come home covered in dust ♪

412
21:12.790 --> 21:16.770
♪ Held by what you love as you roam the world and return ♪

413
21:15.870 --> 21:19.700
[Mother, Mi Xiaoxia]

414
21:18.120 --> 21:22.570
♪ Saying the flowers by the door are truly beautiful ♪

415
21:27.680 --> 21:29.000
I'm getting you a new one.

416
21:28.330 --> 21:31.540
♪ You'll pass through the seasons, through dawn and dusk ♪

417
21:31.910 --> 21:35.190
♪ Hearing someone call your name, again and again ♪

418
21:35.240 --> 21:36.160
One day

419
21:35.480 --> 21:37.960
♪ It hurts to say goodbye ♪

420
21:38.260 --> 21:40.720
♪ If you can't recover, just wait ♪

421
21:39.590 --> 21:40.790
There are many kids here.

422
21:40.790 --> 21:42.270
What if they like it?

423
21:42.950 --> 21:46.000
♪ It will bear witness to the life you bravely lived ♪

424
21:44.270 --> 21:45.680
We are professionals.

425
21:46.400 --> 21:47.400
We can't let amateurs

426
21:46.570 --> 21:49.860
♪ To the beautiful souls you've loved ♪

427
21:47.400 --> 21:48.830
take our business.

428
21:49.590 --> 21:50.310
Right?

429
21:50.220 --> 21:52.340
♪ To the address you call home ♪

430
21:52.830 --> 21:57.720
♪ We come to each other ♪

431
21:58.960 --> 22:01.030
You drive really well.

432
22:01.480 --> 22:02.720
Better than my dad

433
22:02.720 --> 22:03.850
and Rainbow Pillar.

434
22:05.110 --> 22:07.310
It's okay. I'm driving steadily today.

435
22:12.400 --> 22:14.660
I'm going to take the Subject 2 test soon.

436
22:16.550 --> 22:18.280
What's wrong? Are you nervous?

437
22:18.880 --> 22:20.440
It's fine. It's easy.

438
22:21.270 --> 22:22.920
If you fail, just take it again.

439
22:22.920 --> 22:24.070
I took it twice.

440
22:25.960 --> 22:27.200
You took it twice?

441
22:28.110 --> 22:29.840
I was taking the Subject 3 test.

442
22:30.590 --> 22:31.880
Isn't it two people in one car,

443
22:31.880 --> 22:32.830
taking turns?

444
22:33.400 --> 22:34.790
I felt that my examiner

445
22:34.790 --> 22:35.480
was very disrespectful to the person

446
22:35.480 --> 22:37.010
who took the test before me.

447
22:37.070 --> 22:38.270
So I tried to reason with him,

448
22:38.270 --> 22:39.400
and we ended up arguing.

449
22:39.400 --> 22:40.160
In the end, the examiner

450
22:40.160 --> 22:41.720
kicked me out of the car before I even got

451
22:41.720 --> 22:43.160
to touch the steering wheel.

452
22:43.160 --> 22:44.640
That was a pity.

453
22:46.160 --> 22:47.030
Why didn't you hold it in?

454
22:47.030 --> 22:48.480
You could have... well...

455
22:48.480 --> 22:50.480
argued with him after the test.

456
22:50.750 --> 22:51.790
Come on.

457
22:51.790 --> 22:52.790
Could you hold it in if you were me?

458
22:52.790 --> 22:54.030
How could I?

459
22:54.920 --> 22:55.720
I don't put up

460
22:55.720 --> 22:57.380
with being treated unfairly.

461
22:58.110 --> 23:00.200
I must be happy every day.

462
23:00.350 --> 23:01.880
What if someone disagrees?

463
23:02.480 --> 23:03.610
Disagree with what?

464
23:05.400 --> 23:07.590
Disagree with you being happy every day.

465
23:07.590 --> 23:08.720
Who would disagree?

466
23:08.720 --> 23:09.480
I don't know.

467
23:09.590 --> 23:11.400
Just assuming there is such a person.

468
23:11.400 --> 23:12.750
I'd slap him in the face.

469
23:13.830 --> 23:14.830
Disagree?

470
23:15.030 --> 23:17.560
I don't need anyone's permission to be happy.

471
23:17.920 --> 23:19.000
What if it's just

472
23:19.270 --> 23:21.110
that you think you don't need it?

473
23:24.590 --> 23:25.400
What's wrong?

474
23:25.550 --> 23:26.720
Do you disagree with it?

475
23:26.720 --> 23:27.920
Of course not.

476
23:27.920 --> 23:29.450
If you're happy, I'm happy.

477
23:41.400 --> 23:42.160
What are you doing?

478
23:42.160 --> 23:43.090
Aren't you cold?

479
23:48.920 --> 23:49.960
Speed up!

480
23:56.700 --> 24:00.660
[For Dramatic Purposes Only. Do Not Imitate.]

481
23:59.160 --> 24:00.480
I feel it.

482
24:04.070 --> 24:05.480
My mom agrees too!

483
24:07.480 --> 24:09.720
She wants me to be happy every day.

484
24:11.350 --> 24:12.920
I must be happy!

485
24:30.480 --> 24:32.240
This place is so badass.

486
24:33.270 --> 24:34.350
What is this?

487
24:34.720 --> 24:36.050
"Eat skewers with gusto

488
24:37.030 --> 24:38.830
and drink to your heart's content."

489
24:38.830 --> 24:39.560
Not bad, huh?

490
24:39.960 --> 24:41.490
How did you find this place?

491
24:42.480 --> 24:43.750
Just tell me if it's good.

492
24:43.750 --> 24:44.950
Who did you come with?

493
24:46.480 --> 24:47.400
Chen Junnan.

494
24:48.790 --> 24:49.920
I was wondering.

495
24:50.160 --> 24:51.510
I thought you only knew how to call a cab,

496
24:51.510 --> 24:52.200
but you can also find places.

497
24:52.200 --> 24:53.920
Welcome to The Old Captain Restaurant.

498
24:53.920 --> 24:55.750
We have a lucky draw tonight.

499
24:55.750 --> 24:57.640
The first prize is a free meal.

500
24:58.310 --> 24:59.350
Let's try our luck.

501
24:59.350 --> 25:00.110
You draw.

502
25:00.240 --> 25:01.110
I draw?

503
25:02.240 --> 25:03.030
Mix them up.

504
25:03.240 --> 25:03.960
Draw one.

505
25:06.960 --> 25:07.550
This one.

506
25:09.550 --> 25:10.510
And this one.

507
25:14.270 --> 25:15.480
Congratulations!

508
25:16.070 --> 25:17.110
Thank you!

509
25:18.480 --> 25:20.400
What kind of luck was that?

510
25:20.960 --> 25:22.360
It was also my first time.

511
25:22.400 --> 25:23.000
Really?

512
25:23.000 --> 25:24.330
Never done this before.

513
25:25.070 --> 25:25.870
It's too cold.

514
25:27.650 --> 25:31.230
[The Old Captain Restaurant]

515
25:27.720 --> 25:29.120
You just have to be happy.

516
25:29.400 --> 25:30.960
Happiness brings good luck.

517
25:30.960 --> 25:31.550
Right.

518
25:32.830 --> 25:33.510
You're here.

519
25:33.510 --> 25:35.960
Let me see who's so lucky!

520
25:36.000 --> 25:36.720
I am!

521
25:37.270 --> 25:38.240
I was amazing.

522
25:38.240 --> 25:39.270
It was my first time.

523
25:39.270 --> 25:39.930
So awesome.

524
25:40.510 --> 25:41.910
Your luck is incredible.

525
25:42.350 --> 25:43.440
A free meal.

526
25:43.590 --> 25:44.590
I really...

527
25:45.640 --> 25:46.310
Wait.

528
25:46.310 --> 25:47.400
How did they know?

529
25:47.480 --> 25:48.350
Well, here's the thing.

530
25:48.350 --> 25:49.350
I told them no one else could pay.

531
25:49.350 --> 25:50.030
I'm paying today.

532
25:50.030 --> 25:50.830
Then I told the staff

533
25:50.830 --> 25:52.750
to say we won a free meal.

534
25:53.350 --> 25:53.720
Well...

535
25:53.720 --> 25:55.030
This luck.

536
25:55.680 --> 25:57.070
Your luck brings wealth.

537
25:57.070 --> 25:57.640
Come on.

538
25:57.640 --> 25:58.680
Mingming, you drink this.

539
25:58.680 --> 26:00.030
This is... What's the word again?

540
26:00.030 --> 26:00.880
Zero sugar.

541
26:01.110 --> 26:02.510
Really? No gain. No gain.

542
26:02.640 --> 26:03.640
Thank you, Huang.

543
26:03.680 --> 26:04.830
Let's have a drink before we start grilling.

544
26:04.830 --> 26:05.480
Come on.

545
26:05.480 --> 26:06.640
Are you really doing this?

546
26:06.640 --> 26:07.270
Come on.

547
26:07.270 --> 26:07.750
Let's have a drink first.

548
26:07.750 --> 26:08.950
Have a drink. Come on.

549
26:09.640 --> 26:10.270
What should we do?

550
26:10.270 --> 26:10.830
It's fine.

551
26:10.830 --> 26:11.750
It's going to boil.

552
26:11.750 --> 26:12.440
It's going to boil.

553
26:12.440 --> 26:13.640
Flourishing.

554
26:14.880 --> 26:15.880
The vibe is perfect.

555
26:15.880 --> 26:16.880
Come on. Drink up.

556
26:18.590 --> 26:19.350
Let's grill.

557
26:19.480 --> 26:20.640
Grill the meat, come on.

558
26:20.640 --> 26:21.590
Come on, let's grill.

559
26:21.590 --> 26:22.590
It's sizzling.

560
26:24.440 --> 26:24.920
Well, I'll...

561
26:24.920 --> 26:26.120
I'll propose a toast.

562
26:28.590 --> 26:29.450
What did he say?

563
26:29.830 --> 26:31.110
I didn't hear it clearly either.

564
26:31.110 --> 26:32.710
He said he'd propose a toast.

565
26:32.880 --> 26:33.350
What?

566
26:34.160 --> 26:34.830
Zhengliang,

567
26:34.830 --> 26:36.640
you shouldn't have such bad habits.

568
26:36.640 --> 26:37.830
He was "polluted" by us.

569
26:37.830 --> 26:38.890
He got influenced.

570
26:39.440 --> 26:40.240
Wait a minute.

571
26:41.200 --> 26:43.000
Why is your wine steaming?

572
26:43.750 --> 26:45.400
Don't ask for too much.

573
26:45.640 --> 26:46.840
What more do you want?

574
26:46.880 --> 26:48.240
Be nicer to your brother.

575
26:48.240 --> 26:49.200
Are you the only one with a mouth?

576
26:49.200 --> 26:50.310
Alright, alright.

577
26:50.480 --> 26:52.240
Why so serious?

578
26:52.480 --> 26:54.550
You've... made some progress.

579
26:55.070 --> 26:57.270
You'll drink this steaming wine later.

580
26:57.880 --> 26:59.070
I'll drink his wine for him.

581
26:59.070 --> 26:59.750
As usual.

582
26:59.750 --> 26:59.960
Alright.

583
26:59.960 --> 27:01.220
That's very generous.

584
27:01.310 --> 27:02.590
Then I'll speak.

585
27:02.590 --> 27:04.250
Speak, Zhengliang. Go ahead.

586
27:04.880 --> 27:05.720
Well...

587
27:06.350 --> 27:07.680
didn't I get drunk

588
27:07.680 --> 27:09.480
when Huang treated us to dinner?

589
27:09.550 --> 27:11.280
So, after I went back, I had a...

590
27:11.680 --> 27:12.880
very long dream.

591
27:13.790 --> 27:14.480
In the dream,

592
27:14.480 --> 27:17.110
everything was very similar to how things are now.

593
27:17.110 --> 27:18.770
But it was a little different.

594
27:18.960 --> 27:20.720
In the dream, I was very talkative

595
27:20.720 --> 27:21.790
and eloquent,

596
27:21.790 --> 27:23.350
chatting cheerfully with everyone.

597
27:23.350 --> 27:23.750
Really.

598
27:23.750 --> 27:25.270
Well, how did you chat cheerfully

599
27:25.270 --> 27:26.550
with us in that dream?

600
27:26.590 --> 27:27.440
Yeah, what did you say?

601
27:27.440 --> 27:30.040
In the dream, he said, "Let me propose a toast."

602
27:30.680 --> 27:32.920
Who is this guy named "Cheerfully" you were chatting about?

603
27:32.920 --> 27:33.790
What... What were...

604
27:33.790 --> 27:34.400
Go on.

605
27:34.550 --> 27:35.550
What were you talking about with us?

606
27:35.550 --> 27:36.480
What did you say?

607
27:42.110 --> 27:43.110
I forgot.

608
27:44.510 --> 27:46.310
So the dream was for nothing?

609
27:46.310 --> 27:48.110
It's fine. As long as you had a dream.

610
27:48.110 --> 27:49.110
You're hopeless.

611
27:49.880 --> 27:51.880
Alright, if you can't speak, I will.

612
27:52.110 --> 27:52.920
I...

613
27:54.590 --> 27:56.110
I do have something...

614
27:56.350 --> 27:57.160
to say.

615
27:57.350 --> 27:58.030
Go ahead.

616
27:59.590 --> 28:02.310
I'm going to Beijing with Junnan soon

617
28:03.680 --> 28:04.920
to start a business.

618
28:05.920 --> 28:07.590
We're... We're going to do a little business.

619
28:07.590 --> 28:08.270
That's a good thing.

620
28:08.270 --> 28:09.440
You two...

621
28:09.440 --> 28:11.240
You two will definitely make it.

622
28:11.350 --> 28:12.240
Then let me have a drink with you.

623
28:12.240 --> 28:12.960
Come on, let's...

624
28:12.960 --> 28:13.920
Wait a minute.

625
28:14.240 --> 28:15.270
What kind of business?

626
28:15.270 --> 28:15.790
What kind of business?

627
28:15.790 --> 28:17.070
It's... It's that...

628
28:17.200 --> 28:18.110
That...

629
28:19.110 --> 28:19.960
Make it clear.

630
28:20.110 --> 28:21.270
Cervical spine massager.

631
28:21.270 --> 28:22.920
Right, medical equipment.

632
28:22.920 --> 28:24.000
How do you know?

633
28:26.830 --> 28:28.350
He sent me a video,

634
28:28.480 --> 28:30.740
and even pretended to have my dad film it.

635
28:31.110 --> 28:33.640
Just daily work reporting.

636
28:34.200 --> 28:35.240
Come on. Count us in.

637
28:35.240 --> 28:35.510
Look.

638
28:35.510 --> 28:36.070
Come on.

639
28:36.070 --> 28:37.200
Here's to getting rich!

640
28:37.200 --> 28:37.790
Come on.

641
28:37.790 --> 28:38.590
We'll all get rich.

642
28:38.590 --> 28:39.310
Work hard.

643
28:39.310 --> 28:39.880
Okay, okay.

644
28:39.880 --> 28:40.680
Here's to a successful business.

645
28:40.680 --> 28:41.030
Liu Zhengguang.

646
28:41.030 --> 28:42.400
Tell me all about it when we get home.

647
28:42.400 --> 28:43.160
I'll tell you all about it when we get home.

648
28:43.160 --> 28:43.680
No problem.

649
28:43.680 --> 28:45.010
Here's to getting rich.

650
28:45.200 --> 28:46.750
Now that we've talked about starting a business,

651
28:46.750 --> 28:48.210
let's talk about studies.

652
28:48.270 --> 28:49.000
Go ahead.

653
28:49.270 --> 28:51.200
I have an announcement to make too.

654
28:53.440 --> 28:55.570
I've been accepted into a PhD program.

655
28:56.030 --> 28:57.480
I'll be going to Beijing soon,

656
28:57.480 --> 28:58.590
and I'm taking my dad with me.

657
28:58.590 --> 28:59.880
That's amazing.

658
28:59.880 --> 29:00.550
Dr. Che. Come on.

659
29:00.550 --> 29:02.150
Congratulations. Awesome!

660
29:02.270 --> 29:03.510
So... So you two

661
29:03.510 --> 29:04.640
can be together now, right?

662
29:04.640 --> 29:05.240
Well...

663
29:05.240 --> 29:07.000
We'll talk about it privately.

664
29:07.160 --> 29:08.510
I still need to

665
29:08.920 --> 29:10.070
work harder

666
29:10.160 --> 29:11.400
to pursue Mingming.

667
29:11.550 --> 29:12.310
Anyway, right now,

668
29:12.310 --> 29:13.710
I'm still full of energy.

669
29:13.830 --> 29:14.790
Hurry up and eat some meat.

670
29:14.790 --> 29:16.590
I need to be the better version of myself.

671
29:16.590 --> 29:17.830
Congratulations! Congratulations!

672
29:17.830 --> 29:19.960
Congratulations! Congratulations!

673
29:21.350 --> 29:22.070
Speaking of which,

674
29:22.070 --> 29:23.790
I'll be the only one left...

675
29:23.790 --> 29:25.000
at the hospital?

676
29:25.000 --> 29:26.440
How could that be?

677
29:26.680 --> 29:28.000
